Take me as your pupil!

40
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,050
Very well.

41
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:17,090
You are my bestie, after all.

42
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:20,090
Yay! I love you, Milim!

43
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,510
Just when it was getting good...

44
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:44,990
Where'd everyone go?

45
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:52,940
In there, huh?

46
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:57,670
Therefore, I believe the one best 
suited to be in charge of Lady Milim

47
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,340
is her bestie, Great Rimuru.

48
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:00,510
Eep!

49
00:04:00,840 --> 00:04:02,400
I agree.

50
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,100
I also agree.

51
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:05,140
Agreed!

52
00:04:05,330 --> 00:04:06,080
Agreed.

53
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:06,700
Agreed.

54
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:07,790
Agreed.

55
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,130
W-Wait a minute!

56
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:11,420
The majority agrees, so it's settled.

57
00:04:11,420 --> 00:04:16,050
Which means Great Rimuru will henceforth 
be in charge of Lady Milim.

58
00:04:16,050 --> 00:04:17,560
Rimuru!

59
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,730
Did you decide you want 
to be a Demon Lord yet?!

60
00:04:22,130 --> 00:04:23,490
Great Rimuru!

61
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,040
Look what's happened to you!

62
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:27,700
H-He won't come off!

63
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:32,790
Sorry, Milim, but I'm really busy 
building a nation right now.

64
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:36,360
My body is having a tough 
time right now, too.

65
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,670
Besides, a Demon Lord?

66
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:41,550
Wouldn't that just bring me 
more enemies and obligations?

67
00:04:41,550 --> 00:04:44,180
What?! Not at all!

68
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:47,990
I mean, Demon Lords... um, uh...

69
00:04:48,790 --> 00:04:51,900
They can shout out whatever random 
attack names they come up with,

70
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:54,560
and everyone will just go along with it!

71
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,300
Because they're Demon Lords!

72
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,610
Wait, wait! No, no, no, no!

73
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:10,070
Well, what now? You made the mood all weird.

74
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:12,480
It's not my fault.

75
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:21,490
Rimuru! That sound means it's time for lunch!

76
00:05:21,490 --> 00:05:23,130
I know, I know.

77
00:05:23,550 --> 00:05:26,720
But you don't even need to eat food, do you?

78
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:30,530
The food here is yummy, 
so I can eat it over and over!

79
00:05:31,970 --> 00:05:34,010
Then, I'll bring you some.

80
00:05:40,340 --> 00:05:41,980
I'm finished.

81
00:05:45,850 --> 00:05:49,570
Lady Milim, be sure to 
eat your vegetables, too.

82
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,480
These are just straight-up carrots!

83
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:57,110
But they're properly cooked.

84
00:05:57,110 --> 00:05:59,180
They're sweet and delicious.

85
00:05:59,580 --> 00:06:00,510
No!

86
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:03,600
Carrots smell gross! I can't stand them!

87
00:06:05,410 --> 00:06:08,460
Picky eaters don't grow up big and strong.

88
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:09,590
That's fine!

89
00:06:10,150 --> 00:06:13,550
You can still become a Demon 
Lord without eating carrots!

90
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:20,100
Look!

91
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:23,130
I cut them into all kinds of shapes!

92
00:06:24,010 --> 00:06:26,140
Hey, these are cute.

93
00:06:29,380 --> 00:06:30,860
Yummy!

94
00:06:31,290 --> 00:06:34,070
I could eat tons of them 
if they're like this!

95
00:06:37,010 --> 00:06:38,180
Just eat already.

96
00:06:43,500 --> 00:06:45,400
That was so good.

97
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:48,880
The weather's nice today, 
so I'm gonna go explore the town!

98
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:51,110
Oh, that sounds lovely.

99
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:55,240
I'll make some snacks, 
so please come by again later.

100
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:56,390
Snacks?!

101
00:06:56,390 --> 00:06:59,630
Awesome! I can't wait!

102
00:07:00,110 --> 00:07:02,480
But first, you have a town to explore, right?

103
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,780
Oh, yeah!

104
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:08,780
I'll be back!

105
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:16,900
I'll play with you, Ranga!

106
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:22,300
It seems I have no choice in the matter.

107
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,630
But I am Great Rimuru's—

108
00:07:26,140 --> 00:07:27,690
Don't be shy, now.

109
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:30,580
I love pets.

110
00:07:31,630 --> 00:07:33,620
O-Okay...

111
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:35,710
I don't remember it well,

112
00:07:36,050 --> 00:07:38,890
but I think I petted one 
like this a long time ago.

113
00:07:39,330 --> 00:07:43,020
Please... As I was just 
saying, I'm waiting for—

114
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:48,490
<i>Wh-What masterful fingers...</i>

115
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:54,180
<i>She really is a Demon Lord!</i>

116
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:56,830
Is this the spot? Right here?

117
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:59,160
There! There ya go!

118
00:08:02,210 --> 00:08:05,590
Ranga... You like it right here?

119
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:05,590
<i>I'm going to be swept away!</i>

120
00:08:05,590 --> 00:08:07,120
<i>I'll drown!</i>

121
00:08:05,590 --> 00:08:08,160
There! There! There ya go!

122
00:08:08,570 --> 00:08:10,840
<i>Great Rimuru!</i>

123
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:13,040
I see you've been unfaithful.

124
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,510
Well, well...

125
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:21,940
I'll have to tell Great Rimuru about this.

126
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,730
Hup!

127
00:08:25,950 --> 00:08:28,130
So fluffy!

128
00:08:39,950 --> 00:08:43,040
What the heck happened? 
Did Gobta do something?

129
00:08:43,360 --> 00:08:44,320
Hey!

130
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:46,380
Why is that the first thing you say?!

131
00:08:46,580 --> 00:08:49,210
Ooh, you're tougher than I thought.

132
00:08:49,430 --> 00:08:52,080
I just wanted to help you, Lady Milim!

133
00:08:52,950 --> 00:08:56,450
Lady Milim! That outfit looks great on you!

134
00:08:56,450 --> 00:08:59,910
That other one was made for someone 
a bit more voluptuous, y'know?

135
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,310
I only spoke for all of us

136
00:09:04,490 --> 00:09:06,810
in giving you some gentlemanly advi—

137
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,820
Is that true?

138
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:27,120
Oh, I gotta get back to Shuna's place!

139
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:38,580
Those snacks should be ready by now!

140
00:09:41,540 --> 00:09:43,100
Snacks!

141
00:09:43,300 --> 00:09:44,250
Oh!

142
00:09:44,990 --> 00:09:46,760
Welcome back, Lady Milim.

143
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:49,610
Snacks! Snacks! Snacks!

144
00:09:48,070 --> 00:09:49,610
Yes, here you go.

145
00:09:49,610 --> 00:09:52,230
Corn Steamed Buns

146
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:52,350
Yay!

147
00:09:55,210 --> 00:09:57,510
These are tasty, too!

148
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:06,040
Barley
Tea

149
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:18,720
Just make yourself at home.

150
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,550
Slime Diaries.

