152
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:25,020
Slime Diaries

153
00:10:25,950 --> 00:10:27,770
Carrots...

154
00:10:27,770 --> 00:10:31,270
Carrots... Raw carrots are gross...

155
00:10:32,220 --> 00:10:34,270
Middray, make sure they're cooked...

156
00:10:34,270 --> 00:10:37,190
