162
00:10:47,250 --> 00:10:50,790
It's true that Lady Milim can be reckless,

163
00:10:51,370 --> 00:10:56,920
but she's sensible enough to understand 
reason if you just talk to her.

164
00:10:57,780 --> 00:11:01,510
That's why you became her 
friend, too, isn't it?

165
00:11:01,510 --> 00:11:04,760
Well, I guess you're not wrong.

166
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,430
She understood things surprisingly well.

167
00:11:07,430 --> 00:11:08,300
Yes.

168
00:11:10,340 --> 00:11:13,680
I've spent my life watching someone reckless, 
who never thought anything through,

169
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:14,950
so I can tell.

170
00:11:14,950 --> 00:11:17,150
Wow, really?

171
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:20,470
I guess you've had it pretty 
tough, Princess Shuna.

172
00:11:20,900 --> 00:11:23,410
Yep

173
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:27,100
Yes, true.

174
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,250
So what's up?

175
00:11:31,510 --> 00:11:36,670
The truth is... I don't find 
Lady Milim very agreeable.

176
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:38,840
This isn't like you.

177
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:42,010
Are you still bitter because she 
clobbered you when you first met?

178
00:11:43,200 --> 00:11:47,030
If only I'd had more power back then...

179
00:11:49,010 --> 00:11:53,100
You would not have to trouble 
yourself with what Lady Milim does.

180
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:55,010
Shion...

181
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:58,020
You were that concerned about me?

182
00:11:58,450 --> 00:11:59,400
Well, after all...

183
00:12:01,340 --> 00:12:05,160
The only woman who should be 
allowed to trouble you is me!

184
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:08,120
I won't let anyone else have this role!

185
00:12:11,170 --> 00:12:12,630
Are you listening?!

186
00:12:17,710 --> 00:12:19,250
Great Rimuru!

187
00:12:21,050 --> 00:12:23,470
Please let me in!

188
00:12:24,210 --> 00:12:26,760
What kind of face are you making right now?

189
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,190
Great Rimuru!

190
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:44,400
We meet again, Dragonewt... uh...

191
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:47,150
H-Hello, Lady Milim!

192
00:12:47,150 --> 00:12:49,120
Gabiru, wasn't it?

193
00:12:50,340 --> 00:12:53,120
Isn't that amazing? I remember you!

194
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:57,720
Wha... What?! You remember my name?!

195
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:02,590
I love interesting people like you!

196
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,590
Interesting
Tough People

197
00:13:02,830 --> 00:13:04,510
That's our Sir Gabiru!

198
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:05,880
You're a big deal!

199
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:06,430
Indeed!

200
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:19,020
Gabiru! Gabiru! Gabiru!

201
00:13:07,650 --> 00:13:08,900
Aw...

202
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:15,170
It must be my virtuous nature 
and the sweet musk I give off.

203
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:17,020
Just kidding!

204
00:13:18,350 --> 00:13:19,840
I sense...

205
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:22,690
a mysterious connection between us.

206
00:13:23,110 --> 00:13:24,950
Perhaps we are fated...

207
00:13:25,660 --> 00:13:27,700
or ill-fated, as it were.

208
00:13:28,010 --> 00:13:29,270
You haven't...

209
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:34,750
professed yourself a Hero, have you?

210
00:13:37,950 --> 00:13:39,540
Step right up! Come one, come all!

211
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:44,630
See a battle to the death between 
the hero Gabiru and Death Panda!

212
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:45,550
Hero Gabiru VS Death Panda

213
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:47,550
Hero Gabiru
is as shocked as you are

214
00:13:47,810 --> 00:13:48,700
Oh!

215
00:13:47,880 --> 00:13:49,140
Oh!

216
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:51,470
That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime

217
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:50,940
Slime Diaries!

218
00:13:49,550 --> 00:13:51,470
Slime Diaries

219
00:13:53,010 --> 00:13:54,950
Hey, that's one of Clayman's...

220
00:13:57,350 --> 00:13:59,560
Sir Gabiru!

221
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:02,860
My wings won't come out! I'm too panicked!

222
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:03,690
Sir Gabiru!

223
00:14:03,690 --> 00:14:04,240
This way!

224
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:05,020
Good gracious!

225
00:14:05,450 --> 00:14:06,740
Gah, the sunlight!

226
00:14:24,690 --> 00:14:27,850
You are essentially the 
Orc Lord, are you not?

227
00:14:29,740 --> 00:14:33,760
Why live such a mundane life 
when you have so much power?

228
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:40,960
Do you not wish to display 
your might through force?

229
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:47,480
Is it so entertaining to carry rocks around?

230
00:14:51,630 --> 00:14:54,700
There is value in building 
something to leave behind.

231
00:14:58,990 --> 00:15:00,730
We got lots again today!

232
00:15:00,730 --> 00:15:02,710
Yeah. Let's head home.

233
00:15:02,960 --> 00:15:04,210
Mom's waiting.

234
00:15:04,210 --> 00:15:04,740
Yeah!

235
00:15:06,230 --> 00:15:07,210
This is...

236
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:11,400
the task that has been bestowed upon me.

237
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:14,340
Hmm...

238
00:15:15,610 --> 00:15:17,470
I don't understand.

239
00:15:19,740 --> 00:15:21,730
Mind if I watch for a bit longer?

240
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,000
Feel free.

241
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:53,220
Great Rimuru, do you have a moment?

242
00:15:53,220 --> 00:15:54,260
Sure.

243
00:15:58,390 --> 00:15:59,560
What's up?

244
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,410
Well...

245
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:07,900
I would like to report the damages 
caused by Lady Milim thus far.

246
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:10,320
Rigurd... are you angry?

247
00:16:10,770 --> 00:16:13,200
No, no. Certainly not.

248
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:18,660
Doorknobs, window glass, 
eating utensils, etc...

249
00:16:19,100 --> 00:16:22,710
W-Well, for a Catastrophe, 
these are pretty minor damages...

250
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:25,790
Actually, those are only from this morning.

251
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:26,710
This is...

252
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:29,390
the report of damages done this afternoon.

253
00:16:29,390 --> 00:16:30,260
Huh?

254
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:34,010
Uh, Rigurd... are you angry?

255
00:16:34,610 --> 00:16:36,510
Certainly not.

256
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,850
Damage Report

257
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,850
Assembly Building  Doors: more added for a total of 5

